{"sections":[{"slug":"联络","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"联络"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"联络"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">联络是描述</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">丛</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的纤维之间如何沿着底空间上的道路相联系的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">主丛上的联络</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>(<span lang=\"zh\">待补充</span>)</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">局部表达式</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Maurer--Cartan形式","text":"Maurer–Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">形式</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">平凡主丛</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的联络的空间</span> $\\mathcal A(P)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是底流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">值微分形式空间</span> $\\Omega^1(M,\\mathfrak g)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的仿射空间</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间</span>"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称主丛</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">的自同构群为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">规范群</span></strong> $\\mathcal G(P)$, <span lang=\"zh\">规范群作用于</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">通过拉回作用于</span> $\\mathcal A(P)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称之为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/规范变换","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">规范变换</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与自同构的关系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">向量丛的自同构作用于联络的空间</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\alpha$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\operatorname{End}(E)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的截面</span>, $\\nabla$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的联络</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\nabla' =\\alpha\\circ \\nabla \\circ \\alpha^{-1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的联络</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">称</span> $\\nabla'$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $\\nabla$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">规范等价</span></strong> (gauge equivalent).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">可以证明</span>\n$$\r\n\\alpha\\circ \\nabla \\circ \\alpha^{-1} = \\nabla - \\nabla\\alpha \\circ \\alpha^{-1}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3>Levi-Civita <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span></h3>\n<p>Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形的切丛上存在唯一的联络</span> $\\nabla$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\nabla g = 0$ (<span lang=\"zh\">度量相容性</span>);</li>\n<li>$\\nabla_X Y - \\nabla_Y X - [X,Y]=0$ (<span lang=\"zh\">无</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/挠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">挠率</span>"}},{"Plain":", torsion-free).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Levi-Civita联络","text":"Levi-Civita <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>Yang–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/杨--Mills联络","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">杨</span>–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}